<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect height="4" rx="1" ry="1" width="8" x="8" y="2"></rect></svg> Overview</h2>
<p>Recorded Future is the world's largest provider of real-time threat intelligence, using AI and machine learning to analyze over 1 billion indicators of compromise (IOCs) daily from open sources, dark web, technical sources, and proprietary feeds. The platform transforms raw threat data into actionable intelligence that security teams can immediately operationalize.</p>
<p>What sets Recorded Future apart is its patented Risk Score technology that automatically prioritizes threats based on real-time evidence—not just static reputation data. The platform continuously monitors thousands of sources including criminal forums, paste sites, code repositories, social media, and closed threat actor communities to provide early warning of emerging threats targeting your organization.</p>
<p>With native integrations into SIEMs, firewalls, EDR platforms, and security orchestration tools, Recorded Future enriches your existing security infrastructure with contextual intelligence that accelerates detection, investigation, and response.</p>
</section>
